## Pydantic Schemas (Request/Response)

**Use Pydantic v2 for validation. Strict mode.**

```python
# ✅ CORRECT: Strict validation
class CreateMaterialRequest(BaseModel):
    code: str = Field(..., min_length=1, max_length=50, pattern=r"^[A-Z0-9-]+$")
    name: str = Field(..., min_length=1, max_length=255)
    unit_id: str = Field(...)  # Will be UUID in real code

class MaterialResponse(BaseModel):
    id: str
    code: str
    name: str
    created_at: datetime

# ❌ WRONG: Loose validation
class CreateMaterialRequest(BaseModel):
    code: str
    name: str
    unit_id: str
```

