## Structured Logging

**Use structlog. Include context. Never log secrets.**

```python
# ✅ CORRECT: Structured logging with context
logger.info(
    "Inventory reserved",
    extra={
        "tenant_id": str(tenant_id),
        "user_id": str(user_id),
        "material_id": str(material_id),
        "quantity": quantity,
        "correlation_id": correlation_id
    }
)

# ❌ WRONG: Print statements or unstructured logging
print(f"Material {code} created")  # No context
logger.info(f"Password: {password}")  # Secret in log
```

