## Testing Requirements

- **Unit tests:** Pure domain logic (no I/O)
- **Integration tests:** With database
- **E2E tests:** Full API flow
- **Coverage target:** ≥75% for new code

```python
@pytest.mark.asyncio
async def test_material_isolation_between_tenants():
    tenant1_id = uuid.uuid4()
    tenant2_id = uuid.uuid4()
    
    # Tenant1 creates material
    mat1_id = await handler.handle_create_material(
        CreateMaterialCommand(code="MAT-001", name="Steel", ...),
        tenant_id=tenant1_id
    )
    
    # Tenant2 cannot see it
    result = await repo.get_by_id(tenant2_id, mat1_id)
    assert result is None  # Isolation verified
```

